- Method: one 9-workload screen pass with STRATA_DECODE_TIMING=1 (the host's split per window) and STRATA_VERIFY_PROFILE=1 (the GPU stage table); the profile changes the graph (shared expert inline, fused waits off), so its rates run ~2 % low [S167]. The first request (warm-up) is left out; means are window-weighted.
